Space debris is actually a very dangerous creature.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.480
2075

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.340
This is the story of the era when space garbage became a problem.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.570
That's right, senpai.

