00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.330
But be careful.

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:45.290
Sensei!

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:06.800
The light of the weak

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:25.500
I'm a member of the Gengar Alliance.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:28.420
I'm going to be in charge of security for five days from today.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:29.340
Nice to meet you.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:30.500
I'm looking forward to working with you.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:33.500
I'm looking forward to working with you, too!

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:35.420
It's been a long time, Mr. Giggard.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.650
It's been a long time, isn't it, Gan-chan?

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:38.230
How's the security?

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:40.370
Oh, there's someone who's been digging.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:43.210
He's working hard right now.

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:45.310
I'm impressed by that person who's been digging.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.640
Hey, Suna-doki.

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.190
Are you studying properly?

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:52.850
Yes, I am.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:54.980
Tanabe.

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:57.090
Giggard was at home until two years ago.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:03:58.550
