00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.620
Oh, so the teacher is...

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:08.690
Hello, young lady. I'm Hashimaki's teacher.

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:14.290
Oh, you have a teacher.

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:15.750
Of course.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:19.000
Let's have a reunion party. Of course, at the company's expense.

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:21.260
Mr.Gigalto, you're already a civil servant.

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:22.840
