00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.240
As usual, Himawari.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:26.580
Have you seen the young lady?

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:28.920
Himawari's special attack.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:31.100
It's about Ravi.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.960
Phi is a Turbolighter, and the chief is a Marshmallow.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:36.100
I'm not good at remembering names.

00:04:36.840 --> 00:04:38.940
So I'll put a nickname on it and remember it.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.720
Well, only Hachimaki was the one who settled down.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.480
What? Did you put Hachimaki on it?

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.720
Oh, I feel sorry for you for being a newbie.

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.190
Is there something wrong with me?

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.550
From today, for a month,

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.550
I will receive these four security guards from the Mobile Security Agency.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:11.260
All departments will be inspected in order, and the completion of the B team will be scheduled in two weeks, but the instructors will always be in the company, so we will follow all the rules and be careful with the actions.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:14.180
Please do not ask the Ministry of Security for the response to the mobile security business inspection.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:18.860
Oh, no, I have to put together the next business plan.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:25.830
I also have a draft of the contract left, and the deadline for the application at the end of the month is ...

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:27.240
Please let me do it.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:29.970
Ugh, you don't even look at it.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:34.320
It's okay. Let me do it.

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:38.380
I got it. I'll leave this to you.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:40.110
Yes, sir.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.620
I'm sorry. I have plans for that day.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:56.400
I don't have a girlfriend, do I?

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.690
I don't have one, but I'm worried about you.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:05:59.910
Thank you for watching.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:03.350
Is that Tanabe?

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:04.230
Yes.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:13.400
The way to launch a bomb into the ball is the way of the recent space defense war.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:16.540
Please don't neglect the check-up.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.020
This is the tool we use.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:22.190
Make sure you check it yourself at the end.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:23.430
Slow down!

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:24.570
Cut the chip without any cutting-off support.

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:27.430
Adjust it to the completion of the clothes.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:28.790
You do it in 6 minutes!

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:33.810
If you get it, put the sun's will in your head.

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:34.970
Yes, sir!

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:37.380
How many times do I have to tell you to take the vegetables?

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:41.300
Hey, sensei!

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:44.620
Hajimagi, if you go against me...

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:46.120
