00:07:13.916 --> 00:07:14.416
Huh?

00:07:14.748 --> 00:07:21.308
When I had an accident, I thought the universe was really scary, but I'm still doing this job.

00:07:21.436 --> 00:07:24.376
Because you taught me a lot of good things about space.

00:07:24.604 --> 00:07:26.004
You're a good teacher

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:26.640
Ah!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:29.940
That's why I'm grateful to you and I respect you.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.800
