Oh, I haven't been able to contact you lately.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.940
Have you met him before?

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:38.020
He's not Hashimaki, but he's like my teacher.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.850
Roland-san is...

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.920
