00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.560
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.260
Welcome to the Miracle Hall, which is brought to you by Alvin and Ravi!

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.800
First, let's take a look at the new product, Rocket Nola,

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.000
a new technique that uses the balloon Nola!

