00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.300
It's a switch.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.570
That's it.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.360
He's using Hachimaki to switch his feelings.

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:29.620
Oh, that's true.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.340
When it comes to work, I become very serious.

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:34.660
It's not just work. It's private, too.

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.580
I'm going to tie my own head.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.320
I can't change my mind.

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.920
I have to do this because it's work.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.900
I can't do it because I'm a man.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.490
I understand.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:49.910
It's not an easy name because I'm doing it.

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:51.320
