00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:16.870
Well, a swan looks like it's swimming gracefully, doesn't it?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:20.840
But under the water, it's desperately drawing water with its legs.

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.820
I see...

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:25.540
That swan is overdoing a lot.

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:33.510
Claire-kun, when can I get a plan for the security chief?

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:37.280
Yes, by today.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:41.710
Since you said it yourself, I won't help you.

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:43.760
Yes, it's okay.

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:02.020
Debris are the same age as me.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.660
It's just a month after the launch.

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:06.700
Why is there a fever in the Debris?

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:08.710
Stand up?

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:09.210
Hey.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:11.600
I know.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.510
