00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.080
It's the opposite of us.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:25.160
Opposite?

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:28.930
They throw away used nuclear fuel and industrial waste into space.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.420
If you just throw it away, it'll get caught by the sensor.

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:34.890
That's why I'm sticking it together so that it looks like a piece of debris.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:38.700
Isn't that a crime?

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.250
That's why I'm going to catch you.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.550
A robber?

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:45.250
