00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:16.560
Oh, you're getting on my nerves.

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:18.040
But...

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:19.450
Hajimagi!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:20.640
Yes, sir!

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.090
What is this ship for?

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:27.010
What is this ship for?

00:15:27.010 --> 00:15:27.950
Look for a power cable!

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.560
It's an unbreakable arm!

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.760
Cut it off! If you get caught, I'll give you a 20-day sentence!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:35.140
Active stress is working, isn't it?

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:36.720
Phase shifter is in operation.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:38.400
All right, I'll clean it up before the guard comes.

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:39.920
How?

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:44.250
So I'm going to pull in the new ones.

00:15:44.510 --> 00:15:47.210
I don't think there's a new one or a senior in this kind of thing.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:50.170
I can't get my life on the line, but I'm wearing my feet.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:51.950
Wow!

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:59.780
Our combination.

00:15:59.780 --> 00:15:59.980
Thank you for watching.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:01.490
Let's show them what we're made of!

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:02.350
Hachimaki.

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:02.750
