00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:07.050
If you're a man of the universe, don't raise your hand to a woman.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.760
Tsk!

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:10.870
Clean up!

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.780
I said, clean up!

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:13.220
Cut it off!

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:16.220
It's pretty old-fashioned.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.080
I'm not gonna use a hammer like this!

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:18.640
Tsk!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.040
I can't do it!

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:21.110
I'm not gonna use a hammer like this!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:21.610
Tsk!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:22.780
Tsk!

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:24.770
Did they come out from the other side too?

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:25.790
Yes.

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:27.260
It's just the two of them, but they're being pushed.

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:28.500
