00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:40.380
DS-1-2, this is 7.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:43.580
The Mobile Security Division's 11th Squad is heading that way.

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:44.960
Don't do anything too dangerous!

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.220
