00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:58.200
They're going to get us! They're going to get us!

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:59.530
They're going to get us! They're going to get us!

00:16:59.530 --> 00:16:59.790
They're going to get us!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:04.110
You're still not taking off your arm?

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:06.550
Your shoulders are too old and they're too big!

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:08.370
You're too old!

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.860
Damn it!

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:14.770
You're too old!

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:14.850
You're too old!

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:24.930
You're too old!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:29.970
You're too old!

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:45.360
I have to cut him off!

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:04.330
Thanks for watching!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:20.600
Don't make a fuss, Hachi.

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:25.360
Mr.Roland, you too.

00:18:30.480 --> 00:18:30.720
Giga-

00:18:30.720 --> 00:18:33.210
Miss...

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:37.520
I told you not to come out!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:39.220
What are you doing?

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:40.200
Huh?

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:43.840
I can't stand to see you like this!

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:45.380
Right, senpai?

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:47.940
That evil and justice...

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:49.300
Important-

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:50.550
What the hell are you talking about?

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:54.270
Anyway, if you can deliver the teacher to Toy Box, come down immediately!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:55.730
Yes, as soon as possible!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:56.510
Let's go!

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:57.570
You copy?

00:18:57.890 --> 00:18:58.980
Yes, copy!

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:02.000
This is bad!

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:03.050
I'm going to die!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:03.630
Huh?

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:08.660
Increase the power!

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:09.800
It's overheating!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:10.550
I can't keep up!

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:11.450
You bastard!

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.500
Ugh...

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:18.550
Heh heh heh...

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:20.760
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:21.820
You can't move.

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:23.780
I'll cook you slowly.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:24.760
Heh heh heh...

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:25.460
That's perfect!

00:19:26.280 --> 00:19:28.040
Show me how much justice you're a moron!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:28.740
Ah!

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:38.310
This is the Mobile Task Force, Junshi Line Cresta 5-3.

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:42.180
You're taking too much of my time.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.810
Thank you for your help.

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:18.940
Are you alone?

00:20:19.260 --> 00:20:20.390
You're very skilled.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.300
I was just trying to help.

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:25.250
You're the captain of the security team.

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:28.510
Senior, are you okay?

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:29.450
Yes.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.210
A friend of justice has come.

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:33.320
Sorry, Hashimaki.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.080
I'm late.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:35.440
Sensei!

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:35.920
Huh?

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.650
Are you here too, Sensei?

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:39.170
Oh?

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:41.630
Hakim?

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:42.350
Yes.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:43.310
I see.

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:44.840
It's been a while.

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:46.060
By the way,

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:46.960
how's your teaching going?

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:49.600
You too, Sensei.

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:50.580
You too?

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:51.100
Ah.

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:53.000
Nice to meet you.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.260
I'm Hakim Ashumido.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:56.730
I'm Hachirota Hoshino.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.980
I'm a deburier.

00:20:58.260 --> 00:20:59.420
That's good.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:04.650
I can do one thing with your help.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:08.160
I can retire without any worries.

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:10.430
You're still too young.

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:12.260
I don't want to retire.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:14.180
So you found out.

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:17.660
You're in space, so you won't retire until you die.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:18.960
Remember that.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:20.180
Yes, sir!

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:26.180
The time limit is 120 minutes.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.740
Then, you must leave the room 150 minutes later.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:32.110
Please follow the security office's instructions for self-treatment.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:34.220
The report has been submitted today.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:36.860
There are no casualties, right?

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:38.150
Oh, and...

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.670
Hoshino-Kochu-shi is under investigation.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:43.790
How long will the investigation take?

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:47.440
If you don't say anything else, it'll be over in 10 minutes.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:51.370
Since it's about Senpai, it'll take at least 30 minutes.

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:52.550
All right.

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:01.490
Thank you, Angel.

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:03.300
E-Angel?

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:06.180
Could it be my nickname?

00:22:06.640 --> 00:22:08.400
You won't be called a princess forever.

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:11.630
Ah, thank you very much.

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:14.440
But, Angel is a bit too old for me.

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.260
Oh? You don't like it?

00:22:16.580 --> 00:22:17.890
Then...

00:22:22.180 --> 00:22:24.990
Garto!

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:26.860
Let's fight first!

00:22:27.060 --> 00:22:28.810
No, it's fine.

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:30.380
It's not an injury.

00:22:30.760 --> 00:22:31.340
But...

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:31.890
It's cancer.

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:36.490
If you stay in space for a long time,

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:38.340
it's often like this.

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:39.540
I see.

00:22:40.390 --> 00:22:41.910
Come to a place where you can't heal anymore.

00:22:44.400 --> 00:22:44.740
So,

00:22:44.880 --> 00:22:45.720
be quiet.

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:48.600
To him...

00:23:13.280 --> 00:23:14.660
Water meets waves and runs

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:29.140
The day is over and the color of the sky is yellow

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:41.890
Even if you fall down, you'll always be

00:23:45.250 --> 00:23:45.450
Thank you.

00:24:07.580 --> 00:24:07.840
Don't.

00:24:34.320 --> 00:24:36.620
Yuri, you look out from time to time.

00:24:37.100 --> 00:24:38.500
Can you see something?

00:24:38.720 --> 00:24:41.220
Yes, I can see the universe.

00:24:46.010 --> 00:24:46.910
10 minutes have passed.

00:24:47.390 --> 00:24:49.500
When someone important is gone,

00:24:49.880 --> 00:24:52.200
it's neither sad nor painful.

00:24:52.860 --> 00:24:54.660
There's nothing.

00:24:55.160 --> 00:24:56.250
My feelings...
